      "surah_number": 53,
      "ayah_number": 52,
      "juz": 27,
      "hizb_quarter": 211,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "sajda": false,
      "arabic_text": "وَقَوْمَ نُوحٍۢ مِّن قَبْلُ ۖ إِنَّهُمْ كَانُوا۟ هُمْ أَظْلَمَ وَأَطْغَىٰ",
      "english_translation": "as well as the people of Noah before them - [since,] verily, they all had been most willful in their evildoing and most overweening –"
    },
    {
      "ayah_reference": "53:53",
      "surah_number": 53,
      "ayah_number": 53,
      "juz": 27,
      "hizb_quarter": 211,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "sajda": false,
      "arabic_text": "وَٱلْمُؤْتَفِكَةَ أَهْوَىٰ",
      "english_translation": "just as He thrust into perdition those cities that were overthrown"
    },
    {
      "ayah_reference": "53:54",
      "surah_number": 53,
      "ayah_number": 54,
      "juz": 27,
      "hizb_quarter": 211,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "sajda": false,
      "arabic_text": "فَغَشَّىٰهَا مَا غَشَّىٰ",
      "english_translation": "and then covered them from sight forever."
    },
    {
      "ayah_reference": "53:55",
      "surah_number": 53,
      "ayah_number": 55,
      "juz": 27,
      "hizb_quarter": 211,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "sajda": false,
      "arabic_text": "فَبِأَىِّ ءَالَآءِ رَبِّكَ تَتَمَارَىٰ",
      "english_translation": "About which, then, of thy Sustainer’s powers canst thou [still] remain in doubt?"
    },
    {
      "ayah_reference": "53:56",
      "surah_number": 53,
      "ayah_number": 56,
      "juz": 27,
      "hizb_quarter": 211,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 528,
      "ruku": 462,
      "sajda": false,
      "arabic_text": "هَٰذَا نَذِيرٌۭ مِّنَ ٱلنُّذُرِ ٱلْأُولَىٰٓ",
      "english_translation": "THIS IS a warning like those warnings of old:"
